{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 39, :comments [{:quotes [{:he "בכולן מזכיר שמות מקומותיהם", :translit "b'chulan mazkir shemot m'komotaihem", :gloss "in all of them [the Torah] mentions the names of their places"} {:he "חוץ מבעל חנן בן עכבור", :translit "chutz mib'al chanan ben akhbor", :gloss "except for Ba'al Hanan son of Akhbor"} {:he "לפי שלא היה לו מקום ידוע", :translit "l'fi she'lo hayah lo makom yadua", :gloss "because he had no known place"} {:he "שהיו לו אויבים רבים", :translit "shehayu lo oyvim rabim", :gloss "for he had many enemies"} {:he "והיה מתחבא היום כאן ולמחר כאן", :translit "vehayah mitchaveh hayom kan ul'machar kan", :gloss "and he would hide here today and there tomorrow"} {:he "ולא היה יושב במקום ידוע", :translit "velo hayah yoshev b'makom yadua", :gloss "and he did not dwell in a known place"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :other, :note "Textual observation: Ba'al Hanan son of Akhbor alone lacks a named city, explained narratively rather than through numerical wordplay."}], :frame nil} {:quotes [{:he "ושם אשתו", :translit "veshem ishto", :gloss "and the name of his wife"} {:he "מזכיר שם אשתו", :translit "mazkir shem ishto", :gloss "[Scripture] mentions the name of his wife"} {:he "מלמד שמלך על ידה", :translit "melamed shemalach al yadah", :gloss "this teaches that he ruled through her"} {:he "שהיתה בת גדולים ועשירים", :translit "shehayah bat g'dolim va'ashirim", :gloss "for she was a daughter of great and wealthy men"} {:he "מונה כאן ח' מלכים", :translit "moneh kan chet melachim", :gloss "[Scripture] counts here eight kings"} {:he "וי\"א אלופים", :translit "veyod aleph alufim", :gloss "and eleven chieftains"} {:he "וכנגדן נאמרו בישראל י\"א שופטים מיהושע עד שמואל", :translit "uch'negdan ne'emru b'yisra'el yod aleph shoftim mihoshua ad shmu'el", :gloss "and corresponding to them were appointed over Israel eleven judges from Joshua until Samuel"} {:he "וח' מלכים עד יורם", :translit "vechet melachim ad yoram", :gloss "and eight kings until Joram"} {:he "וזהו ואלכה